iknowamerica (12) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add persistent player statistics when running outside Sugar, using the
    user's application data directory.
  * Refresh country information across 30 country and territory datasets,
    including government officials, population, GDP, HDI, and selected
    historical and currency details.
  * Standardize country statistics formatting, include reference years, and
    update dataset timestamps.
  * Consolidate screen navigation, input handling, and animations into a single
    event loop.
  * Improve menu, pagination, End, and Show All controls using rectangular hit
    areas.
  * Centralize coordinate scaling and geographic category configuration.
  * Simplify resource loading, question selection, map labels, and progress
    rendering.
  * Fix launching the application from a different working directory by
    resolving resources relative to the script.
  * Fix point selection and marker alignment at different display scales.
  * Fix map-region detection for missing masks and clicks outside image
    boundaries.
  * Correct detection colors for the Guanajibo River and Savan Island.
  * Remove the duplicate Newfoundland entry from the Canada map.
  * Correct geographic names and mismatches between map data and questions,
    including Santiago del Estero, Lake Ilopango, Lake Izabal, Tacuarembó River,
    and Guri Reservoir.
  * Restore the missing Rosario entry in Paraguay's city questions.
  * Fix first-run statistics handling and reject malformed or invalid statistics
    files.
  * Prevent repeated statistics saves from counting the same play time multiple
    times.
  * Use a monotonic clock for elapsed play time.
  * Save statistics through an atomic file replacement to reduce the risk of
    corruption.
  * Fix sound toggling in Sugar and allow operation when audio initialization
    fails.
  * Handle unsupported custom cursors gracefully.
  * Fix SugarGame keyboard handling for Pygame 2 key codes and guard against
    unsupported mouse-button indices.
  * Ignore repeated key events and non-left mouse clicks in game controls.
  * Improve exit handling, distinguish skipping the introduction from closing
    the application, and restore the previous screen after viewing About or
    Statistics.
  * Correct misplaced German translation entries.
  * Avoid unnecessary display updates by refreshing only when the screen
    changes.
  * Convert loaded images to the display pixel format while preserving
    transparency.
  * Expand the README with screenshots, installation instructions, dependencies,
    and instructions for launching from another directory.
  * Update English credits and licensing text.
  * Expand historical Debian changelog entries.
  * Remove duplicated code and simplify loading and rendering helpers.
  * Replace the previous seven-value player statistics format with six integer
    values, including a checksum.
  * Calculate average scores from cumulative scores and game counts instead of
    storing the average.
  * Legacy statistics files are no longer loaded.

 -- Alan Aguiar <alanjas@hotmail.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:25:17 -0300

